<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50876" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴπτομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴψομαι</span>: aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰψάμην</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>press hard, oppress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα δ᾽ ἴψαο λαὸν Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.454
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				16.237
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάχα δ᾽ ἴψεται υἷας Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.193
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>hurt, harm</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ
				τόνδε μηρὸν ἴψω</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				<u>Adon.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.6.7
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴπτω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλάπτω</span>
			, only in <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				481.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶψαι, ἴψας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Perh. related to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάπτω</span>
			(B) or to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶπος</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
